    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add chicken mince, tender coriander stems, onions, tomato, green chillies, ginger, fresh coriander leaves, whole egg, salt to taste, boiled eggs, salt to taste, gram flour and give it a good mix.",
      "Wet the hands with water, take a portion of prepared mixture, place the tomato slice on one side and give it the desired shape.",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it's hot, place prepared kebabs and cook it 4-5 minutes until golden in colour on both the sides.",
      "Transfer it to a serving platter, garnish it with coriander sprig and pomegranate pearls.",
      "Serve hot with prepared onion salad and green chutney.",
      "In a bowl, add onion, roasted cumin, salt to taste, lemon juice, degi red chili powder and give it a good mix.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add onion, green chillies, fresh coriander leaves, fresh mint leaves, tamarind pulp, salt to taste, degi red chili powder, ginger and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it into a smooth paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use."
    ],
